[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0010","text":"哇哦\n巡，这幅画……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0020","text":"……！\n这个────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0030","text":"巡……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0040","text":"……呢\n抱歉，不自觉就……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0050","text":"怎么了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0060","text":"没事……\n只是觉得有点像而已"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0070","text":"你看，这幅画……\n是不是有点像制作人？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0080","text":"……啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0090","text":"灯织……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0100","text":"……！\n抱歉……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30300300_04_0102","text":"Motion"}]
